dispatch.prompt:
[NEW TASK: {task_id}] {title}{deps_info}
Specification:
{spec}

Implement the requirements on a clean branch up to date with {branch}, write tests and commit.

review.prompt.previous:
This is ANOTHER review attempt for this card. The previous review ({report}) ended with FAIL and these blockers:
{blockers}
For each of them check in the code whether it was fixed and say so explicitly ("fixed: …" or "not fixed: …"). List an unfixed one again as a `[BLOCKER]` finding. Then review the rest of the change as usual.

service.next_remove:
If they were enabled:
  systemctl --user disable --now {units}
  systemctl --user daemon-reload
